WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.662
Day 10. The Final Check.

2
00:00:02.112 --> 00:00:07.069
Day ten is the final check. Your child uses their page. You mark yours.

3
00:00:07.519 --> 00:00:14.145
The letters look a little different today. They are in a typeface that is in no other page of the book, and in a new order.

4
00:00:14.745 --> 00:00:19.135
So your child has to know each letter, not its place on the page. Do not help.

5
00:00:19.735 --> 00:00:25.651
Then read the box on your page, and put it beside the day one page. Scan the code to see the report.

6
00:00:26.251 --> 00:00:31.229
What comes next is the letter sounds. Our plan Eight Sounds That Stay starts right there.
